Default is 16.",
        ["noclip"] = "For noclip, use the Noclip script in the Scripts tab, or I can provide a custom solution!",
        ["esp"] = "ESP (Extra Sensory Perception) lets you see players through walls. Check the Scripts tab for ESP options!",
        ["aimbot"] = "Aimbot automatically aims at targets. Use responsibly! Check Scripts tab for aimbot options.",
        ["admin"] = "Admin scripts give you commands. Try Infinite Yield from the Scripts tab - it's the most popular!",
        ["dex"] = "Dark Dex is an advanced game explorer. Find it in the Scripts tab under Utility category!",
    }

